IQ-151 C++11 / SDL2
==================
This project is a derivative port of https://github.com/omikron88/iq-151
at commit 5bd21af8a332c14483f184bb30f7074c1eea80d8.
Upstream authors include Omikron, tmilata and contributors named in that source.
License: GPL-3.0-or-later (see LICENSE).

The CPU opcode implementation, 8255 implementation, keyboard matrix, memory and
I/O mapping, video algorithms and ISN format were translated from that project.
Pio8255: Copyright (c) 2006 Roman Borik <pmd85emu@gmail.com>, GPL-3.0-or-later.
The ROM images, character ROM, BASIC SD loader and original toolbar icons are
copied from the upstream repository and embedded unmodified. No independent
ownership or new licensing of those historical ROMs or artwork is asserted.
The fixture snapshots and hashes were produced by running the upstream Java
implementation. tests/reference records how to reproduce the comparison.

