* Dear ImGui v1.91.9b, commit f5befd2d29e66809cd1110a152e375a7f1981f06.
  Copyright (c) 2014-2025 Omar Cornut. MIT license, see
  third_party/imgui/LICENSE.txt. Includes imstb headers with their own notices.
* SDL2 release-2.32.10, commit 5d249570393f7a37e037abf22cd6012a4cc56a71.
  Copyright (C) 1997-2025 Sam Lantinga and contributors. zlib license,
  see third_party/SDL2-LICENSE.txt. Retrieved as a pinned, SHA-256 verified
  source archive by CMake when a system SDL2 is not used.
* Statically linked GCC runtimes use the GCC Runtime Library Exception.
  See third_party/GCC-RUNTIME-LIBRARY-EXCEPTION.txt.

The SDL frontend, media/file adapters, CMake build and tests in this port are
GPL-3.0-or-later. Distributing a binary of the emulator requires complying with
the GPL, including providing the corresponding source and these notices.
